msgstr "확인"

msgid "Are you sure you want to clear the record of chat?"
msgstr "채팅 기록을 지우시겠습니까?"

msgid "Clear"
msgstr "클리어"

msgid "Send"
msgstr "보내기"

msgid "Thinking..."
msgstr "생각 중..."

msgid "Thought process"
msgstr "사고 과정"

